flowchart LR
    subgraph Squat
        S1[Calculate knee angle<br/>hip-knee-ankle] --> S2[knee < 165 deg<br/>stage down, down frames +1<br/>store minimum knee angle]
        S2 --> S3[down frames >= 3<br/>and knee > 165 deg]
        S3 --> S4[Count repetition first]
        S4 --> S5[min knee > 115 deg<br/>not_deep_enough]
        S5 --> S6[majority issue<br/>video label shallow/correct]
    end
    subgraph Bicep_Curl
        C1[Calculate elbow angle<br/>shoulder-elbow-wrist] --> C2[elbow > 125 deg<br/>stable extended/down]
        C2 --> C3[elbow < 115 deg<br/>stable curled/up]
        C3 --> C4[return to stable extended<br/>count repetition first]
        C4 --> C5[min elbow > 55 deg<br/>half_range_of_motion]
        C5 --> C6[majority issue<br/>video label half_range/correct]
    end
